sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Parser as Parser (LLM)
    participant Embed as Embedding (LLM)
    participant FAISS as FAISS
    participant Filters as Filters
    participant Judge as Judge (LLM, optional)
    participant Composer as Outfit Composer (LLM)
    participant Finalize as Finalize (server)

    Client->>API: POST /outfit {query, use_judge}
    API->>Parser: parse_query(query)
    Parser-->>API: facets
    API->>Embed: embed_query(query)
    Embed-->>API: vector
    API->>FAISS: search(vector)
    FAISS-->>API: row ids
    API->>Filters: apply filters
    Filters-->>API: kept cands
    alt use_judge==true
        API->>Judge: judge_batch(cands[:M])
        Judge-->>API: scores + why
        API->>API: rank pool
    else
        API->>API: pool from retrieval
    end
    API->>Composer: compose_outfit(facets, pool)
    Composer-->>API: OutfitPlan (slots)
    API->>Finalize: join canonical info, dedupe ids, compute total, enforce required slots
    Finalize-->>API: slots + totals + under_budget
    API-->>Client: 200 {slots, total_price, under_budget, trace.timings}

    Note over Finalize,API: Server ensures no duplicate ids across slots and recomputes totals
